{% if convention == 'conventional-commits' %}
## Conventional Commits Format

```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

<body>

<footer>
```

**Types**:
- feat: New feature
- fix: Bug fix
- docs: Documentation
- style: Formatting
- refactor: Code restructuring
- test: Tests
- chore: Maintenance

**Example**:
```
feat(auth): add JWT authentication

Implement JWT-based authentication system with refresh tokens.

Closes #123
```
